@startuml dsd_uc1_endSale
' NewEra POS - Design sequence diagram, UC1 Process Sale: endSale() (Contract 3), W11
' Team D - editable source of assets/dsd_uc1_endSale.png
' Participants: logical view (architecture.md 4.2). Operations: system_interfaces.md 3.2, 4.1; fallback of AD-07.
title DSD UC1 Process Sale - endSale() (Contract 3)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 6
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B7791F
hide footbox
box "ui.api" #EAF2E3
  participant "ctrl:SaleController" as C
end box
box "application" #E8EEF7
  participant "h:SaleHandler" as H
end box
box "domain" #FFF7E0
  participant "s:Sale" as S
end box
box "application.interfaces" #F6EDF7
  participant ":TaxCalculator" as TA
  participant "settings:SettingsRepository" as SET
end box

[-> C : POST /api/sales/{saleID}/end
C -> H : endSale()
H -> S : hasLines()
S --> H : boolean
alt no line items (6a)
  H --> C : NO_LINES
  C -->[ : 409 "Add at least one item"
else at least one line
  H -> S : toTaxRequest()
  S --> H : TaxRequest(transactionID, lines)
  H -> TA : calculateTax(request)
  note right of TA : the adapter applies the 5 s timeout (IR-05, AD-07)\nthe screen shows a waiting message after 1 s (NFR-18)
  alt answer within 5 s
    TA --> H : TaxResult(OK, taxPerLine, totalTax)
    H -> S : setTax(taxPerLine)
  else timeout or error (7a)
    TA --> H : TaxResult(NOT_AVAILABLE)
    H -> SET : current()
    SET --> H : settings (default tax rate)
    H -> S : applyDefaultTaxRate(rate)
    note right of S : taxToBeCorrected = true (IR-05)\nthe Accounting record will carry the mark
  end
  H -> S : complete()
  note right of S : isComplete = true\ntotal = subtotal + tax (tax rounded per line, SRS Q8)
  S --> H : subtotal, tax, total, taxToBeCorrected
  H --> C : TotalResult(subtotal, tax, total, taxToBeCorrected)
  C -->[ : 200 subtotal, tax, total\n(warning when the default tax rate was used, NFR-15)
end

note over H
  GRASP
  Information Expert: Sale computes its tax per line and its total.
  Indirection, Protected Variations: the handler calls the TaxCalculator interface; the stub and the real system are interchangeable (DC-02, AD-04).
  The fallback is decided by the handler, the timeout by the adapter (AD-07).
end note
@enduml
